      "extract": "The skein models. The account here largely follows those of [10], [6] and [9]. The framed Homﬂy skein relations, in their simplest form, are − = (s −s−1) 2 and = v−1 . The coeﬃcient ring can be taken as Λ = Z[v±1, s±1] with monomials in {sk −s−k : k ≥0} admitted as denominators. The framed Homﬂy skein S(F) of a planar surface F, with some designated input and output boundary points, is deﬁned to be Λ-linear",
